==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & 2'''===
No particular strategy is needed. However, watch out for that low deploy limit. Use fast meatshields and strong anti-Alien [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]]. [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] works great as a meatshield here, and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] and [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] are great for attacking.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Ironically enough, replacing Spacefish Jones with Mesocosmocyclone makes the stage arguably easier. [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|Crowd-controllers]] like [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] are great for stalling Mesocosmocyclone, while Catellite still does well as a meatshield, though using [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Saw Cat]] can also help if Catellite is at a low level.

